WEBVTT

NOTE Ambient instrumental music. All instructions appear on screen.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000 line:84% position:50% size:90% align:center
Your first steps.
Start with the account setup checklist. Keep your login and authenticator information private.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000 line:84% position:50% size:90% align:center
Create your account.
Choose Create an account. Enter your name, email and a unique password, then review the terms.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000 line:84% position:50% size:90% align:center
Verify your email.
Open the verification link sent to your email, then sign in. Check spam if the message is missing.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000 line:84% position:50% size:90% align:center
Complete identity review.
Open Account settings and submit the required identity details. Wait for an approved KYC review.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000 line:84% position:50% size:90% align:center
Add another layer.
Enable two-factor authentication in Account settings. Use your authenticator for current six-digit codes.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000 line:84% position:50% size:90% align:center
Know before you proceed.
Funding requires verified email, approved KYC, two-factor authentication and enabled platform funding.
